         Welcome to the Town Clerk's Office website! We hope that you find the following information helpful and informative concerning the services that we provide to the residents of North Andover. Business Certificates (DBA’s, Doing Business As) Find more information on  how to obtain a Business Certificate .  Dog Licensing Those residents who have access to a computer can  license their Dog(s) online . By Mail: North Andover Town Clerk, 120 Main Street, North Andover, MA 01845, Or drop off check in the black Town Hall Business Mail drop box in front of Town Hall. Please be aware that dogs have to be current with their rabies vaccination(s), please send with registration. Standard License Fees 1-Year Unaltered Dog $20 Spayed/Neutered Dog $19 Effective January 1, 2021, any dog owner age 70 + can now register their dog at no cost.  Please contact the Town Clerk's office.  Proof of age will be required. View a listing of current registered dogs Elections Click here to submit a  vote by mail application .  If you are not able to print out the application, please send any written form of correspondence with your signature requesting an absentee ballot.  NOTE:  An application must be submitted for each calendar year.  Applications from prior year(s) do not carry over. Absentee ballots  are available by contacting the Town Clerk's office at 978-688-9501.  Absentee ballots are by appointment only. These requests should be  emailed to the Town Clerk , mailed to: North Andover Town Clerk, 120 Main Street or placed in the Town Hall Business Mail Dropbox in front of Town Hall. Marriage Intentions / Justice of the Peace Services Please call the office at 978-688-9501 to schedule an appointment to file for a marriage license.  If you are in need of a Justice of the Peace to perform your wedding vows, please  email the Town Clerk / JP, Dawne Warren .  Learn  how to obtain a marriage license . Vital Records Request If you wish to request a birth, marriage or death record, please click below.  The event must have occurred in North Andover in order for us to have the record in our files.  Feel free to call to confirm before processing the online request. Request a Vital Record Voter Registration You May Register to Vote Online You May Register to Vote by Mail Check Voter Status Voter, Town Meeting and Election Information and Documents Annual Reports 2019 Annual Report 2020 Annual Report 2021 Annual Report 2022 Annual Report 2023 Annual Report 2024 Annual Report 2025 Annual Report 
     

 
